<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA A BEAT WEST INDIES BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA A BEAT WEST INDIES BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia A beat West Indies by</p>
<p>six wickets in their one-day 50 overs match at the Melbourne</p>
<p>Cricket Ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:- West Indies 217-8 in 50 overs (Shivnarine</p>
<p>Chanderpaul 72); Australia A 218-4 in 44.4 overs (Ian</p>
<p>Harvey 67 not out, Darren Lehmann 63 not out).</p>
</text>
